  "usage": {
    "summary": "`good-world-map` plots country data on a zoomable, pannable map. It shares `GoodChartDataSource` and the GoodUI marker palette with the other data visualizations. The geometry is bundled and loaded only when a map is opened; it requires no tile service or API key. The map uses Natural Earth 5.1.2 country boundaries via `@cublya/world-atlas` 3.0.0-beta.2. See [Natural Earth's terms](https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/) and [World Atlas data license](https://cublya.github.io/world-atlas/guides/boundary-data-licensing/).",
